      "source": "Nagashino Teppo-Ashigaru",
      "description": "Part of the Battle of Nagashino folding screen. The warrior with the helmet on the far left is Tadakatsu Honda, and Yanosuke Harada has a part of the Hata flag on that side. The Tokugawa clan are lined up in front of the horse fence, and the warlords riding from above are Nobunari Naito, Tadayo Okubo, and Tadasa Okubo. The headless Takeda warrior on the far right is Masakage Yamagata, who was hit by ammunition, and his vassal, Mataemon Shimura, ran away without being robbed of his rank. The groove in the center of the screen is the Rengo River, and the dirty moya is the smoke of the gun.",
